1
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:10,400
Come on, smile.

2
00:01:10,880 --> 00:01:11,800
Cheese.

3
00:01:18,240 --> 00:01:19,760
Look, isn't it pretty?

4
00:01:19,800 --> 00:01:20,730
It's beautiful.

5
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,200
Second Brother.

6
00:01:23,039 --> 00:01:24,560
Zhangxin, you're awake.

7
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,600
How do you feel?

8
00:01:26,840 --> 00:01:28,200
Where is the young master?

9
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,360
The second young master

10
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,680
is lying in his room.

11
00:01:32,280 --> 00:01:34,039
I clearly saw him.

12
00:01:34,039 --> 00:01:36,200
Why were you suddenly lying
next to the freezer truck?

13
00:01:36,200 --> 00:01:37,400
If I hadn't passed by,

14
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:38,840
who knows how long
you would have been lying there.

15
00:01:38,840 --> 00:01:40,280
Did you open the door?

16
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:42,280
The door was open the whole time.

17
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,080
Zhangxin,

18
00:02:17,040 --> 00:02:18,440
How could it be?

19
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:34,680
Second Master,

20
00:02:35,160 --> 00:02:36,280
is that you?

21
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,560
Why are your hands so cold?

22
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:05,840
How is it?

23
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:07,600
Is the pressure okay?

24
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,200
Mrs. He,

25
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:12,800
don't think the domestic violence scandal

26
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,520
will blow over so quickly.

27
00:03:14,760 --> 00:03:17,880
I still need to observe you for a while.

28
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:26,600
Then how about this

29
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,800
as compensation?

30
00:03:28,320 --> 00:03:30,579
This watch is worth a downtown building.

31
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:36,660
You're giving me such an expensive gift.

32
00:03:37,120 --> 00:03:39,040
If the master finds out,

33
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:41,360
how do I explain it?

34
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:44,600
Just hide it

35
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,400
and check the time secretly.

36
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,720
Wouldn't that work?

37
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,720
The master isn't home.

38
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:55,040
You're getting more and more arrogant.

39
00:03:55,200 --> 00:03:57,960
You really think you're
the master of the manor.

40
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,880
Once the master dies,

41
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,680
this estate

42
00:04:02,160 --> 00:04:03,720
will be all ours.

43
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:18,640
The family rules echo
with a lasting charm.

44
00:04:18,880 --> 00:04:22,600
The instructions in the hall
are profound and long.

45
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:26,160
The love between kind parents
and filial children weaves a net.

46
00:04:26,160 --> 00:04:28,160
I can't believe that didn't kill you.

47
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:30,400
Today will be

48
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,060
your last day in the He family.

49
00:04:40,720 --> 00:04:42,080
Are you ready?

50
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:45,040
I'm ready.

51
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,360
Honey,

52
00:05:00,520 --> 00:05:01,650
does that feel good?

53
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:08,320
It feels great.

54
00:05:46,880 --> 00:05:47,840
Look!

55
00:05:48,040 --> 00:05:49,440
Since the butler loves

56
00:05:49,440 --> 00:05:51,240
broadcasting his fetish so much,

57
00:05:51,240 --> 00:05:52,360
I'll grant his wish.

58
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:52,800
Look.

59
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:19,760
Madam, look!

60
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:24,320
Liu Dan!

61
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:32,720
Liu Dan!

62
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:34,800
Mrs. He,

63
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,720
please don't be mad.

64
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:36,400
Calm down.

65
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:37,760
Mrs. He,

66
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,360
I'm sorry.

67
00:06:38,760 --> 00:06:39,720
Stop him!

68
00:06:39,720 --> 00:06:41,000
Mrs. He, don't be mad.

69
00:06:41,080 --> 00:06:42,320
Let me go!

70
00:06:43,200 --> 00:06:45,960
Someone like you who ruins
the He family's reputation

71
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,620
doesn't deserve to stay here.

72
00:06:47,680 --> 00:06:49,120
Get out!

73
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:50,600
No, Mrs. He!

74
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,400
How can you abandon me?

75
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:54,080
You're fired.

76
00:06:55,159 --> 00:06:57,400
Mrs. He!

77
00:06:57,640 --> 00:06:58,240
Let me go!

78
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,200
Mrs. He!

79
00:07:06,960 --> 00:07:10,000
Let me go!

80
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,160
Open the door!

81
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:23,360
Open the door!

82
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,040
Open the door!

83
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:29,280
I've worked hard for the He family
for over 20 years.

84
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:32,159
Even if I have no merits,
I've put in the effort.

85
00:07:32,159 --> 00:07:34,240
How can you treat me like this?

86
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:38,320
Open the door!

87
00:07:46,200 --> 00:07:47,720
Leaving the He family...

88
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,200
How am I supposed to live?

89
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:04,500
You finally got what's coming to you.

90
00:08:07,400 --> 00:08:08,360
You bitch.

91
00:08:09,600 --> 00:08:10,360
You

92
00:08:10,760 --> 00:08:11,440
You

93
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:13,880
I wish I could kill you.

94
00:08:14,080 --> 00:08:14,840
Li Zhangxin,

95
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,880
you don't have to push me this far.

96
00:08:21,520 --> 00:08:23,520
This burn scar...

97
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:27,320
This look in your eyes...

98
00:08:27,760 --> 00:08:28,640
You're

99
00:08:28,720 --> 00:08:29,880
He Mei.

100
00:08:37,640 --> 00:08:39,000
Stay away.

101
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,040
Stay away!

102
00:08:47,440 --> 00:08:48,840
It wasn't me.

103
00:08:48,880 --> 00:08:51,160
Mrs. He told me
to get rid of you back then.

104
00:08:51,160 --> 00:08:52,880
But you ran off on your own.

105
00:08:52,880 --> 00:08:55,040
Mrs. He is the real culprit.

106
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,760
Rest assured.

107
00:09:01,880 --> 00:09:03,200
Her end

108
00:09:03,400 --> 00:09:05,000
will be even worse than yours.

109
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:07,000
Aren't you afraid I'll tell Mrs. He?

110
00:09:09,080 --> 00:09:10,000
Do you think she'd believe

111
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,400
an abandoned pawn?

112
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:52,360
Who was driving at the time?

113
00:09:54,280 --> 00:09:55,720
Besides Zhang Xin,

114
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,880
who else wants to harm me?

115
00:10:50,160 --> 00:10:51,220
What are you doing?

116
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:53,000
You're awake.

117
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:54,520
I am...

118
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,520
Brother-in-law.

119
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,720
You're awake.

120
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,920
I'll go tell everyone right now.

121
00:11:06,320 --> 00:11:07,080
He Yu,

122
00:11:07,280 --> 00:11:08,600
you're finally awake.

123
00:11:08,720 --> 00:11:10,520
You have no idea how happy I am.

124
00:11:10,520 --> 00:11:12,000
Look, I had the kitchen prepare

125
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,960
so many dishes for you early this morning.

126
00:11:13,960 --> 00:11:14,520
Come,

127
00:11:14,520 --> 00:11:15,180
have a seat.

128
00:11:15,200 --> 00:11:15,800
Roujing,

129
00:11:15,800 --> 00:11:17,160
see what He Yu likes to eat.

130
00:11:17,160 --> 00:11:19,240
Have the kitchen make
a few more dishes for him.

131
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:19,640
Serve the food.

132
00:11:19,640 --> 00:11:21,080
It's already prepared, Mrs. He.

133
00:11:21,080 --> 00:11:21,960
Good.

134
00:11:23,360 --> 00:11:24,720
He Yu, eat this.

135
00:11:25,440 --> 00:11:26,480
Have some of this.

136
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:28,720
He Yu, and this.

137
00:11:29,040 --> 00:11:30,720
He Yu, eat this.

138
00:11:32,240 --> 00:11:33,200
And this.

139
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,560
He Yu,

140
00:11:35,560 --> 00:11:36,640
you have no idea.

141
00:11:36,640 --> 00:11:37,760
While you were in a coma...

142
00:11:37,760 --> 00:11:39,800
It seems my second brother
hates Zhang Xin too.

143
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:42,160
But Zhang Xin is in charge
of the family now.

144
00:11:42,160 --> 00:11:43,400
To be safe,

145
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:44,560
I'll wait for Dad to come back

146
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:45,960
and do the paternity test

147
00:11:45,960 --> 00:11:47,800
before I acknowledge my second brother.

148
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:48,560
By the way,

149
00:11:48,760 --> 00:11:50,720
the driver who hit you
hasn't been found yet.

150
00:11:50,720 --> 00:11:52,760
Do you remember anything?

151
00:11:53,960 --> 00:11:55,200
Sure enough,

152
00:11:55,200 --> 00:11:57,860
this is what she cares about most
after I woke up.

153
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:00,090
I did think about it carefully,

154
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:03,420
but I can't remember clearly.

155
00:12:03,760 --> 00:12:04,560
It's fine.

156
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:06,160
Here, have some more shrimp.

157
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:07,920
Could it be that

158
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:10,240
my second brother's car crash
wasn't an accident?

159
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:10,800
Cheers.

160
00:12:17,080 --> 00:12:18,040
Bottoms up, bro.

161
00:12:19,880 --> 00:12:21,200
The scenery is picturesque,

162
00:12:21,200 --> 00:12:22,530
and Rongcheng is small.

163
00:12:22,560 --> 00:12:24,200
There aren't many good people,

164
00:12:24,200 --> 00:12:25,860
but they're all at this table.

165
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:28,960
Come on, bro,

166
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,800
let's drink.

167
00:12:29,800 --> 00:12:31,480
It's so noisy.

168
00:12:32,400 --> 00:12:33,200
Right, right.

169
00:12:33,200 --> 00:12:34,260
We'll keep it down.

170
00:12:36,040 --> 00:12:36,960
Bro.

171
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,090
Does that feel good?

172
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:44,760
Bro, your phone.

173
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:51,000
Honey,

174
00:12:51,000 --> 00:12:52,120
He Yu is awake.

175
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:53,320
Hurry home.

176
00:12:59,560 --> 00:13:00,680
Bro, your phone.

177
00:13:08,440 --> 00:13:09,320
Go away.

178
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:11,960
Bro,

179
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:12,880
are you okay?

180
00:13:14,160 --> 00:13:15,200
Do you guys

181
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:17,400
want to meet my wife?

182
00:13:18,960 --> 00:13:19,760
He Yu,

183
00:13:19,760 --> 00:13:21,920
this is Li Zhangxin,

184
00:13:21,920 --> 00:13:22,760
the nanny who's been taking care of you.

185
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:23,840
Rongcheng University

186
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,520
Zhangxin,

187
00:13:24,520 --> 00:13:26,440
this is the second young master, He Yu.

188
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,040
I'll leave him in your care.

189
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,000
Just a moment.

190
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:32,760
Hey honey,

191
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,200
come to the club.

192
00:13:36,160 --> 00:13:36,920
Okay.

193
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:40,410
What's wrong, Roujing?

194
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:42,840
He Shi asked me to go to his private club.

195
00:13:42,840 --> 00:13:43,720
It's so late.

196
00:13:44,320 --> 00:13:45,080
It's fine.

197
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,360
He's probably drunk

198
00:13:46,360 --> 00:13:47,820
and wants me to pick him up.

199
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,100
You can go back to work.

200
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:08,160
What is it?

201
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,640
Do you have something to ask me?

202
00:14:09,640 --> 00:14:11,440
Why did you pretend to be asleep?

203
00:14:14,520 --> 00:14:15,850
That's my own business.

204
00:14:16,680 --> 00:14:17,560
You just need

205
00:14:17,560 --> 00:14:19,160
to do your job.

206
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:23,090
Did the Second Young Master

207
00:14:23,760 --> 00:14:25,720
go to the freezer truck before?

208
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:26,920
No.

209
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:45,280
Honey!

210
00:14:45,280 --> 00:14:46,360
Hello, ma'am.

211
00:14:46,640 --> 00:14:48,320
Honey,

212
00:14:49,320 --> 00:14:51,450
here comes the highlight of the night.

213
00:14:55,840 --> 00:14:57,480
Wanna have a drink with my wife?

214
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:59,140
Honey, you're joking, right?

215
00:15:00,160 --> 00:15:00,800
Boss,

216
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:02,200
your wife is pregnant.

217
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:04,800
Is it your first day knowing me, He Shi?

218
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:05,720
Honey...

219
00:15:11,640 --> 00:15:13,440
We won't leave
until we're drunk tonight, boys!

220
00:15:13,440 --> 00:15:14,280
Honey, don't do this.

221
00:15:14,280 --> 00:15:15,160
I'm scared.

222
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:16,360
Honey!
